/-!
# Loop lemmas of the real-format `fmt.errorf` stub (amd64)

GENERATED by `scripts/dev/errorf/gen_loops64.py`: one decimal loop per number, one byte-copy loop per segment, each
for the stub `ErrorfRealCode64.code64` at its own loop head and exit, with the rest of the run as a continuation.
-/

namespace Janus.Contracts.ErrorfRealLoops64

